<main class="rc-wrap"><section class="rc-page-head"><span class="rc-kicker">Your journey</span><h1>Booking requests, made simple.</h1><p>RentACar currently uses a booking-request flow rather than a shopping cart. Choose a vehicle, enter your dates and send a request. You will see a booking reference when the request is accepted by the server.</p></section>
<section class="rc-basket"><div class="rc-panel"><span class="rc-kicker">How it works</span><h2 style="font:800 27px Manrope;margin:12px 0">Three steps to your next ride</h2><div class="rc-feature" style="margin:14px 0"><span class="num">STEP 01</span><h3 style="margin:12px 0 7px">Choose a vehicle</h3><p class="rc-muted">Browse the available fleet and check each car's daily rate and details.</p></div><div class="rc-feature" style="margin:14px 0"><span class="num">STEP 02</span><h3 style="margin:12px 0 7px">Enter your trip details</h3><p class="rc-muted">Add pickup and drop-off locations, date and time, and contact details.</p></div><div class="rc-feature" style="margin:14px 0"><span class="num">STEP 03</span><h3 style="margin:12px 0 7px">Send your request</h3><p class="rc-muted">The system checks for overlapping bookings and provides a reference if the request is created.</p></div></div>
<aside class="rc-basket-aside"><span class="rc-kicker" style="color:#c8ff00">Ready to roll?</span><h2 style="font:800 29px Manrope;margin:14px 0">Find the right car for your plans.</h2><p>No fake cart totals or card forms. Booking totals are calculated from the selected car's daily rate and rental duration.</p><a class="rc-btn" href="/fleet">Explore available cars ↗</a><p style="font-size:12px;margin-top:16px">Payment processing is not enabled in this booking flow. Do not enter card details on this page.</p></aside></section></main>
